    "updated_at": "2025-06-06T12:51:52Z",
    "body": "Same thing happens when trying to move apps between different \"dynamic zones\". The first move will go through but any subsequent moves will result in grabbing the entire \"dynamic zone\" instead of individual apps.\nExiting edit mode and going back in seems to be the best workaround I've found.\nI'm on version 1.22.0",
